CM_ SG_ 884 TyreTrim_FL "Learned tolerance trim of the front-left wheel; the wheel speed is scaled by 1 + trim/100.";
CM_ SG_ 884 TyreTrim_FR "Learned tolerance trim of the front-right wheel; the wheel speed is scaled by 1 + trim/100.";
CM_ SG_ 884 TyreTrim_RL "Learned tolerance trim of the rear-left wheel; the wheel speed is scaled by 1 + trim/100.";
CM_ SG_ 884 TyreTrim_RR "Learned tolerance trim of the rear-right wheel; the wheel speed is scaled by 1 + trim/100.";
CM_ SG_ 884 TyreTrimStatus "0 after power-up, 1 once the tolerance learner has adapted (low confidence).";
CM_ SG_ 1936 Const_b0 "Always 0.";
CM_ SG_ 1936 YawReference "Yaw-rate reference of the sensor monitoring. Raw.";
CM_ SG_ 1936 MasterPressure "Master-cylinder pressure. Raw (firmware pressure units).";
